{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The part-group element indicates groupings of parts in the score, usually indicated by braces and brackets."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Braces that are used for multi-staff parts should be defined in the attributes element for that part. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"part-group start element appears before the first score-part in the group. The part-group stop element appears"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after the last score-part in the group."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPartGroup"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The number attribute is used to distinguish overlapping and nested part-groups, not the sequence of groups. As","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with parts, groups can have a name and abbreviation. Values for the child elements are ignored at the stop of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a group.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A part-group element is not needed for a single multi-staff part. By default, multi-staff parts include a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"brace symbol and (if appropriate given the bar-style) common barlines. The symbol formatting for a multi-staff","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"part can be more fully specified using the part-symbol element.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"<part-group>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" element.","type":"